"""
tests/test_pabot_attempt_and_loop_termination.py
=============================================================================
Automated test suite verifying:
1. REQ-EXEC-014: Strict Attempt Bounding, Guaranteed Loop Termination, and Definite Exit State Finalization for Pabot Runs.
2. Hard ceiling enforcement on retry limits (clamping invalid/excessive retries to [1, 3]).
3. Immediate loop termination on success (attempt 1 pass does not cycle to attempt 2).
4. Unconditional loop termination on max_retries exhaustion (never spins in infinite loop).
5. Deterministic exit state finalization (COMPLETED, FAILED, or FAILED_DETERMINISTIC; deactivated pulse flag).
6. Deep Boundary Value Analysis (BVA) for payload retries (None, 0, -1, 5, 2).
=============================================================================
"""

