            matrix_rows.append(f"| **{req_id}** | [EPIC-API] Backend Integration | `{ep}` | REST Endpoint | Network connectivity active | Dispatch `GET` request | HTTP 200/204, valid JSON schema | Latency < 800ms, timeout handling | `{tc_id}` |")
