    obstruction_table = "\n".join(obstruction_matrix_rows) if obstruction_matrix_rows else "| **REQ-DYN-001** | [EPIC-DYNAMIC] Environmental Obstruction Neutralization | N/A | Environmental Resilience | Page load complete | Monitor page for floating chat boxes, permission prompts, carousels, autoplay media, and login walls | All obstructions neutralized or cataloged seamlessly without blocking test execution | Resilient graceful recovery | `TC-DYN-00` |"

